      "body": "### Project URL\n\nhttps://github.com/Blue-B/pisesh\n\n### Category\n\nJS\n\n### Project Title\n\npisesh - TUI session manager for the Pi coding agent\n\n### Project Description\n\npisesh is a zero-dependency terminal UI for Pi coding-agent sessions: favorites, search, custom titles, a project view, and AI titles. Install with `pi install npm:pisesh` and run `/sesh` inside Pi. v0.3.0 switches sessions via Pi's ctx.switchSession() API.\n\n### Highlights\n\nSingle-file Node script with zero runtime dependencies, CJK-aware column alignment for Korean/Chinese/Japanese prompts, alt-screen rendering like vim/less, and read-only session files (sidecar JSON only).\n\n### Screenshots or Demo Videos\n\n![pisesh](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Blue-B/pisesh/main/assets/screen-list.png)\n",
